# Greater Sonic Wave is a Forinthry (Wilderness) unlock, not Misthalin.
#
# Its codex drops from the risen ghosts and armoured phantoms in the crypt
# beneath Fort Forinthry, which sits on the south-eastern Wilderness edge. The
# Misthalin links came from the superseded fort-forinthry: record, whose own
# note called that filing provisional - "the crypt is north of the Fort in
# Wilderness geography" - and they were carried onto the survivor by the overlap
# adjudication before anyone ruled on them. This is the ruling.
#
# The rule this follows: Fort Forinthry itself stays Misthalin, and the ~37 other
# records filed under that working taxonomy are right as they are. What moves is
# content physically in the Wilderness - the crypt monsters are north of the Fort
# - because Wilderness content requires the Wilderness region. Being reachable
# through a Misthalin building does not make the drop Misthalin.
